### FASE 7 · SOS y modos de la zona (ingresa primero con requests/auth.http)
@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = pega-aqui-el-accessToken

### SOS (idempotente por clientId) -> 201 { notifiedNeighbors, contactsNotified, brigadeNotified, smsCode }
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "5f1b0c2a-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "lat": -11.9790, "lng": -77.0030 }

### Elegir el tipo durante la cuenta regresiva (recalcula el código SMS)
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/sos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "HEALTH" }

### SOS activos cerca de mí
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sos/nearby?radiusM=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Responder: GOING | DECLINED | ARRIVED
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "GOING" }

### Estoy a salvo / Cancelar
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/safe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check-in en emergencia (SAFE avisa a mis contactos)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SAFE" }

### Mi zona y su modo
GET {{base}}/api/v1/zones/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Volver a normal solo en mi app (DISMISS) / ACTIVATE_LOCAL_EMERGENCY / CLEAR_LOCAL
POST {{base}}/api/v1/me/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "DISMISS" }

### Municipalidad (999000000): modo de la zona. PREVENTION con weatherLevel = alerta El Niño
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/zones/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "PREVENTION", "reason": "Aviso SENAMHI por lluvias intensas", "weatherLevel": "ORANGE" }
